ared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","review_id":"1UsuJ_qTqRikol4i_SjS2w","date":"2019-07-31T20:08:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367680549621582,"text_excerpt":"Had a wonderful time brunching on a Saturday morning in the quarter. The interior, especially by the bar, is beautiful. Great atmosphere from the architecture, to the furniture, to the music in the background. The french doors were open to let in the breeze and the sounds from the street. Almost wanted to sit at the sidewalk tables, but too many carriage tours pass by for that, ha! That morning they were running a tasting menu for a great price - choose an app / entree / dessert - so my husband went that direction and loved everything! App of fried green tomatoes w/ shrimp, entree of crawfish etoufee, and dessert of bread pudding. He washed it down with the strawberry lemonade, made in ho..."},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","review_id":"ozwEMD8-iQ3XLQ45nTqjFg","date":"2016-01-01T23:08:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9331710934638977,"text_excerpt":"With a 1+ hour wait for Stanley, we decided to walk over here instead. Glad we did! Food was delicious, and though, as some have said, service was slow, it was not because they were just slacking. Everyone was hustling, but.. more importantly, everything was yummy. For drinks-- Cucumber Bloody Mary was outrageously good, so was the Soule Aulait. Started with some beignets while we were waiting for our meals, they were piping hot and really just as good as Cafe du Monde. My crawfish omelette was great, so was the French dip and crawfish etouffee (which appeared to be closely related to the omelette). Only complaint was the rub on the blackened shrimp and fried green tomato po'boy. It was w..."},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","review_id":"dE0BGS2QGEm7U-eS4VRUPw","date":"2018-10-08T02:07:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296765327453613,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love this place. My friend was married here up stairs in the Paris Room balcony 5 years ago this weekend. We are back to celebrate their anniversary. I arrived about 1:15-1:30p on a Saturday afternoon. Breakfast is served until 2p at least on Saturday. I was promptly seated. They were not to busy but did have a large party. Now I traveled to this spot specifically for a waffle. This woman loves a waffle and will try one in every state. So the pecan waffle and the Eggs Soule' (Benedict with Crab Cakes). Yes, multiple breads were involved but wait for the full review before you judge. The waffle was just right for me. It wasn't hard and airy at all. Medium to soft, moist, and g..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","photo_id":"dxdg0-NpQzg3WFulmkmbOw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/dxdg0-NpQzg3WFulmkmbOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8532432317733765},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","photo_id":"Rq68pQhQGpIHjQFq20AOFg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Rq68pQhQGpIHjQFq20AOFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8016388416290283},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","photo_id":"1ci4YXAl_lUJLHct6xG3eQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1ci4YXAl_lUJLHct6xG3eQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7811821103096008},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","photo_id":"UOiGWtu41PGI7A8dxOvzOg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/UOiGWtu41PGI7A8dxOvzOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7676310539245605},{"business_id":"SjiRaZoWaDpkCCpq5SsrMw","photo_id":"i0LdhL9k6Rz7_u1E6R__cQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/i0LdhL9k6Rz7_u1E6R__cQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7622336745262146}]},"notebook_case":null}
